24:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:tracking-tight prose-p:leading-8 prose-a:text-blue-700","children":[["$","section","The real cost of selling on Etsy in 2026",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The real cost of selling on Etsy in 2026"}],[["$","p","Etsy charges are layered, not flat. A $40 item with $5 shipping can easily incur $0.20 (listing fee) + $2.93 (6.5% transaction on $45) + $1.60 (3% + $0.25 payment processing on $45) = $4.73 in core fees alone. That is 10.5% of the order total before you account for materials, labor, packaging, or marketing.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Etsy charges are layered, not flat. A $40 item with $5 shipping can easily incur $0.20 (listing fee) + $2.93 (6.5% transaction on $45) + $1.60 (3% + $0.25 payment processing on $45) = $4.73 in core fees alone. That is 10.5% of the order total before you account for materials, labor, packaging, or marketing."}]]}],["$","p","If the order comes through Offsite Ads at the 15% rate, add another $6.75. If you are a UK seller, add 0.35% regulatory fee and potentially 2.5% currency conversion. The total can reach 25% or more. These are not hidden fees — Etsy discloses them — but they are easy to underestimate when you are focused on making and shipping products.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"If the order comes through Offsite Ads at the 15% rate, add another $6.75. If you are a UK seller, add 0.35% regulatory fee and potentially 2.5% currency conversion. The total can reach 25% or more. These are not hidden fees — Etsy discloses them — but they are easy to underestimate when you are focused on making and shipping products."}]]}],["$","p","The calculators on this page exist to make these numbers explicit. Enter your actual costs and expected sale price, and see the full fee breakdown in seconds. The goal is not to discourage selling on Etsy; it is to help sellers price with their eyes open. Etsy provides access to millions of buyers. The fees are the cost of that access. Knowing them precisely lets you decide whether each order is worth it.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"The calculators on this page exist to make these numbers explicit. Enter your actual costs and expected sale price, and see the full fee breakdown in seconds. The goal is not to discourage selling on Etsy; it is to help sellers price with their eyes open. Etsy provides access to millions of buyers. The fees are the cost of that access. Knowing them precisely lets you decide whether each order is worth it."}]]}],["$","p","A common mistake is treating Etsy fees as a single percentage. In practice, the fee stack is a combination of fixed amounts (listing fee, payment processing fixed component) and variable rates (transaction fee, payment processing percentage, optional Offsite Ads, regulatory fees, currency conversion). Fixed fees hurt more on low-value orders. Percentage fees hurt more on high-value orders. The only way to understand your specific situation is to run your own numbers.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"A common mistake is treating Etsy fees as a single percentage. In practice, the fee stack is a combination of fixed amounts (listing fee, payment processing fixed component) and variable rates (transaction fee, payment processing percentage, optional Offsite Ads, regulatory fees, currency conversion). Fixed fees hurt more on low-value orders. Percentage fees hurt more on high-value orders. The only way to understand your specific situation is to run your own numbers."}]]}]]]}],"$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30"]}]
